{"license":"DANS Licence","fileAccessRequest":true,"metadataBlocks":{"citation":{"displayName":"Citation Metadata","name":"citation","fields":[{"typeName":"title","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Getuigen Verhalen, Papua's in diaspora, interview 04"},{"typeName":"otherId","multiple":true,"typeClass":"compound","value":[{"otherIdAgency":{"typeName":"otherIdAgency","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"DANS-KNAW"},"otherIdValue":{"typeName":"otherIdValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"easy-dataset:41194"}}]},{"typeName":"author","multiple":true,"typeClass":"compound","value":[{"authorName":{"typeName":"authorName","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Stichting PACE ©"}}]},{"typeName":"datasetContact","multiple":true,"typeClass":"compound","value":[{"datasetContactName":{"typeName":"datasetContactName","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"A.M  Kamerman"},"datasetContactAffiliation":{"typeName":"datasetContactAffiliation","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"stichting papua cultureel erfgoed"}}]},{"typeName":"dsDescription","multiple":true,"typeClass":"compound","value":[{"dsDescriptionValue":{"typeName":"dsDescriptionValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"<p>Geïnterviewde no. 4 is geboren in kampong Tobati. Hij vertelt over zijn leven als kind en de scholen die hij heeft doorlopen. Hij vertelt over de onontplofte bommen uit de Tweede Wereldoorlog waar ze als kinderen bij speelden. Hij herinnert zich de Amerikanen, die kwamen met een overvloed aan rantsoenen, en de ontmoeting met zwarte Amerikanen. Hij is in de oorlog gevlucht.<\/p><p>Hij gaat naar de JVVS, (jongensvervolgschool) daarna naar de LTS. Vervolgens gaat hij naar de Zeevaartschool in Ramadi waar hij wordt opgeleid als assistent-weerwaarnemer en telegrafist. Na de Indonesische infiltraties neemt hij ontslag omdat hij de situatie niet vertrouwt, en gaat werken als instrumentmaker. Hij is pro Nederlands en besluit in 1962 om naar Nederland te gaan.<br><br>De geïnterviewde maakt deel uit van de ervaringsgemeenschap van ooggetuigen van een migratiegeschiedenis van Nieuw Guinea naar Nederland.<\/p>"}},{"dsDescriptionValue":{"typeName":"dsDescriptionValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Date Submitted: 2010-01-12"}}]},{"typeName":"subject","multiple":true,"typeClass":"controlledVocabulary","value":["Arts and Humanities","Social Sciences"]},{"typeName":"keyword","multiple":true,"typeClass":"compound","value":[{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Amerikaanse bommen"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Nederlandse marine"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Bommen"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Amerikaanse soldaten"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Japanse soldaten"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Amerikanen"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Tower"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Militairen infiltrant"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Commandant"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Soldaten VN"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Pakistanis"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Adat"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Pidgin"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Kerk"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Zwarte mensen"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Zending"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Gurus"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Amboneze jongens"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Maleis"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Nederlands"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Chinese kinderen"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Koreri beweging"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Assistent weerwaarnemer"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Telegrafist"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Baroes"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Tjotjok"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Nederlandse consul"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Scheepswerf Konijnenburg"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"President Kennedy"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Kadaster"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Hotel Terminus"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Pension Nooitgedacht"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Willemsparksweg"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Gerrit Vermeulen school"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Technische school"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Ministerie van Defensie"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Energiebedrijf Rijnland"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Dansgroep Sampari"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Soekarno"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"oral history"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Tweede Wereldoorlog"}}]},{"typeName":"language","multiple":true,"typeClass":"controlledVocabulary","value":["Dutch"]},{"typeName":"productionDate","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"2009-05-22"},{"typeName":"distributionDate","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"2011-11-01"},{"typeName":"dateOfDeposit","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"2009-05-22"},{"typeName":"series","multiple":true,"typeClass":"compound","value":[{"seriesInformation":{"typeName":"seriesInformation","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"<p>In 1942 werd Nederlands-Indië, en daarmee ook Nieuw-Guinea, door Japan bezet. Toch slaagde de Japanners er niet in om geheel Nieuw-Guinea te veroveren. Nederlandse guerrillastrijders bleven strijd voeren en zouden zich voor een deel ook nooit overgeven. De bevolking van Nieuw-Guinea werd hierdoor geconfronteerd met bezetting en geweld, maar ook met een steeds sterker wordend Indonesisch nationalisme.<\/p><p>Na de capitulatie van Japan riep Soekarno de Republik Indonesia uit, die het gehele voormalig Nederlands-Indië moest omvatten. Nederland weigerde echter Nieuw-Guinea op te geven. Tot 1962 bleef dit gebied onderdeel uitmaken van het Koninkrijk. De dreiging van een Indonesische aanval, gecombineerd met forse diplomatieke druk vanuit de Verenigde Staten en de Verenigde Naties, zorgde er uiteindelijk voor dat Nederland zijn laatste koloniale ambities terzijde moest schuiven.<\/p><p>Stichting PACE heeft deze geschiedenis belicht door in dit project persoonlijke verhalen vast te leggen van 25 Papua's en anderen die in de periode 1940-1963 in Nieuw-Guinea verbleven. Zij vertellen over hun vroege jeugdherinneringen en de ervaringen tijdens de Tweede Wereldoorlog. Maar ook verhalen zij over hoe het, vaak gedwongen, vertrek naar Nederland hebben ervaren en hoe dit hun verdere leven heeft beïnvloed.<br><br>Papua's kennen een traditie van het mondeling overdragen van verhalen. De interviews die nu zijn vastgelegd, passen heel goed in deze traditie. Ze bieden bovendien een unieke inkijk in de gevolgen van grootschalig geweld binnen een geïsoleerde samenleving die op die manier hardhandig werd betrokken bij de wereldgeschiedenis.<\/p>"}}]}]},"dansRights":{"displayName":"Rights Metadata","name":"dansRights","fields":[{"typeName":"dansRightsHolder","multiple":true,"typeClass":"primitive","value":["Stichting Papua Erfgoed"]},{"typeName":"dansPersonalDataPresent","multiple":false,"typeClass":"controlledVocabulary","value":"Unknown"},{"typeName":"dansMetadataLanguage","multiple":true,"typeClass":"controlledVocabulary","value":["Dutch"]}]},"dansRelationMetadata":{"displayName":"Relation Metadata","name":"dansRelationMetadata","fields":[{"typeName":"dansAudience","multiple":true,"typeClass":"primitive","value":["https:\/\/www.narcis.nl\/classification\/D34300","https:\/\/www.narcis.nl\/classification\/D60000"],"expandedvalue":[{"@id":"https:\/\/www.narcis.nl\/classification\/D34300","termName":[{"lang":"nl","value":"Moderne en contemporaine geschiedenis"},{"lang":"en","value":"Modern and contemporary history"}],"vocabularyUri":"https:\/\/www.narcis.nl\/classification\/"},{"@id":"https:\/\/www.narcis.nl\/classification\/D60000","termName":[{"lang":"en","value":"Social sciences"},{"lang":"nl","value":"Sociale wetenschappen"}],"vocabularyUri":"https:\/\/www.narcis.nl\/classification\/"}]},{"typeName":"dansCollection","multiple":true,"typeClass":"primitive","value":["https:\/\/vocabularies.dans.knaw.nl\/collections\/ssh\/ce21b6fb-4283-4194-9369-b3ff4c3d76e7","https:\/\/vocabularies.dans.knaw.nl\/collections\/ssh\/a651bf8a-8589-40fe-97af-b1b7c6278ffe","https:\/\/vocabularies.dans.knaw.nl\/collections\/ssh\/213a59ea-8d36-42c6-b30b-474ebbdef61d","https:\/\/vocabularies.dans.knaw.nl\/collections\/ssh\/d1ddfd7a-192d-4c32-b15a-a111d1de745b","https:\/\/vocabularies.dans.knaw.nl\/collections\/ssh\/cfa04ed6-4cd0-4651-80cb-ed4ca8fa14f3"],"expandedvalue":[{"@id":"https:\/\/vocabularies.dans.knaw.nl\/collections\/ssh\/ce21b6fb-4283-4194-9369-b3ff4c3d76e7","vocabularyUri":"https:\/\/vocabularies.dans.knaw.nl\/collections"},{"@id":"https:\/\/vocabularies.dans.knaw.nl\/collections\/ssh\/a651bf8a-8589-40fe-97af-b1b7c6278ffe","vocabularyUri":"https:\/\/vocabularies.dans.knaw.nl\/collections"},{"@id":"https:\/\/vocabularies.dans.knaw.nl\/collections\/ssh\/213a59ea-8d36-42c6-b30b-474ebbdef61d","vocabularyUri":"https:\/\/vocabularies.dans.knaw.nl\/collections"},{"@id":"https:\/\/vocabularies.dans.knaw.nl\/collections\/ssh\/d1ddfd7a-192d-4c32-b15a-a111d1de745b","vocabularyUri":"https:\/\/vocabularies.dans.knaw.nl\/collections"},{"@id":"https:\/\/vocabularies.dans.knaw.nl\/collections\/ssh\/cfa04ed6-4cd0-4651-80cb-ed4ca8fa14f3","vocabularyUri":"https:\/\/vocabularies.dans.knaw.nl\/collections"}]},{"typeName":"dansRelation","multiple":true,"typeClass":"compound","value":[{"dansRelationType":{"typeName":"dansRelationType","multiple":false,"typeClass":"controlled